            "title": "Are Pet Drinking Fountains Noisy?",
            "text": "<p>Many pet drinking fountains are designed to operate quietly, with some models offering noise-reducing features. However, noise levels can vary depending on the model and the type of pump used. If noise is a concern, look for pet drinking fountains labeled “quiet” or “silent.”</p>"
